 systemd
Recommends: dolphin, plasma-systemsettings
Description: KDE Plasma CIFS mounts backed by static systemd units
 nasmount adds and removes persistent CIFS shares through a KAuth helper.
 Shares use root-owned systemd mount and automatic-mount unit pairs. They are
 armed at boot and exposed through a System Settings KCM and a Dolphin
 service-menu dialog.
